          "Lead with homeowner economic security in a moderate-income district: At $76,300 income and 41.9 median age, the core constituency is aging homeowners managing fixed costs that are rising faster than incomes. Property tax policy, rural hospital viability, and healthcare cost management are the legislative priorities most likely to activate genuine constituent loyalty rather than taking the 100% result for granted.",
